(SCOPE OF WORK) Tj T*
(This specification covers supply and installation of borewell submersible) Tj T*
(pumpsets and water quality testing complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION — BOREWELL SUBMERSIBLE PUMPSETS) Tj T*
(3.1 Submersible pumpsets shall be manufactured to IS 8034:2018.) Tj T*
(3.2 Duty point of each pumpset shall be 18 cum/hr at 90 m total head.) Tj T*
(3.3 Overall pumpset efficiency at duty point shall be minimum 52 per cent.) Tj T*
(3.4 The submersible motor shall be of rewindable wet type as per IS 9283:2013.) Tj T*
(3.5 Flat submersible cables of 3 core 6 sq mm copper, PVC insulated, shall) Tj T*
(comply with IS 694:2010 and be tested to IS 10810.) Tj T*
(3.6 The starter panel shall include dry run protection, overload relay and) Tj T*
(single phasing preventer.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART D — TREATED WATER QUALITY) Tj T*
(4.1 The quality of water supplied shall meet IS 10500:2012.) Tj T*
(4.2 pH value: 6.5 to 8.5) Tj T*
(4.3 TDS of supplied water shall be within 2000 mg/litre.) Tj T*
(4.4 Turbidity of treated water shall be limited to 1 N.T.U..) Tj T*
(4.5 Fluoride content shall be within 1.0 mg/litre.) Tj T*
(4.6 Nitrate as NO3 shall be less than 45 mg/litre.) Tj T*
(4.7 Arsenic content in supplied water shall be less than 0.01 mg/litre.) Tj T*
(4.8 Total hardness shall be within 200 mg/litre as CaCO3.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
(Page 2 of 4) Tj T*
