(5 TESTS AND INSPECTION) Tj T*
(5.1 Physico-chemical tests on water samples shall follow IS 3025.) Tj T*
(5.2 Pre-dispatch inspection shall be offered to the Department's authorised) Tj T*
(representative with 15 days notice.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6 DOCUMENTATION, WARRANTY AND TRAINING) Tj T*
(6.1 Monthly water quality reports shall be furnished to the Department.) Tj T*
(6.2 Shop drawings and schematic diagrams shall be got approved from the) Tj T*
(Engineer-in-charge before manufacture.) Tj T*
(6.3 O&M manuals, as-built drawings and catalogues shall be furnished in) Tj T*
(triplicate at the time of handing over.) Tj T*
(6.4 The supplier shall replace free of cost any part found defective within the) Tj T*
(defect liability period of 24 months.) Tj T*
(6.5 Training of two operators for one week shall be imparted by the supplier) Tj T*
(after commissioning.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
